schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-1-# Terra Mortis Character Data Schema v2
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-2-
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-3-## Design Principles
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-4-
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-5-1. **Consistency**: Same structure for similar data. No mixed formats (int vs object for the same field type).
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md:6:2. **Derive, don't store**: Speed, Defence, Health, Willpower max, Vitae max are all calculable from attributes, merits, and BP. Store only what can't be derived.
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md:7:3. **Unified merits**: One array, categorised. Display grouping and CSV column mapping are presentation concerns handled at render/export time.
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-8-4. **Specs as arrays**: A skill can have multiple specialisations. Always an array, even if empty.
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-9-5. **Flat where possible**: Avoid nesting that doesn't earn its keep.
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-10-
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-11----
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-12-
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-13-## Schema
