schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-227-## What Changes from Current
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-228-
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-229-| Area | Old | New |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-230-|------|-----|-----|
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-231-| Attributes | `3` or `{dots:3, bonus_dots:1}` | Always `{dots:3, bonus:0}` |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-232-| Skills | `3` or `{dots:3, spec:"foo"}` | Always `{dots:3, bonus:0, specs:["foo"], nine_again:false}` (absent = 0) |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-233-| Merits | `["Closed Book ●●●"]` (strings) | `[{name, rating, category, ...}]` (objects) |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md:234:| Influence | separate `influence[]` array | merged into `merits` with `category:"influence"` |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md:235:| Domain | separate `domain` object | merged into `merits` with `category:"domain"` |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md:236:| Standing | separate `standing` object | merged into `merits` with `category:"standing"` |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-237-| Pacts | buried in `powers[]` | moved to `powers[]` with `category:"pact"` |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md:238:| Manoeuvres | encoded in merit strings | `merits` with `category:"manoeuvre"` |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-239-| `xp_left` | stored | derived from `xp_total - xp_spent` |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-240-| Derived stats | stored | calculated |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-241-| `covenant_standings` | array with all 4 | object keyed by label, primary excluded |
schemas/schema_v2_proposal.md-242-| `willpower` keys | `mask_all_wp` | `mask_all` (drop redundant `_wp` suffix) |
